Task: Drizzle ORM Schema & Database Persistence (TDD)

Summary of Changes:
- Defined Drizzle ORM SQLite schema for cooperatives, kitchens, farmers, commodities, deliveries, delivery_items, and proof_of_delivery with CHECK constraints, foreign key rules, and relations.
- Configured better-sqlite3 database client with WAL journaling, foreign_keys enforcement, and busy_timeout, plus Drizzle Kit migrations and an immutability trigger on proof_of_delivery.
- Implemented idempotent database seed module (src/db/seed.ts) pre-populating Subang and Banyumas cooperatives, SPPG kitchens, farmers, staple commodities in IDR, and sample deliveries across DRAFT, DISPATCHED, and VERIFIED states.
- Added comprehensive unit tests for schema constraints, database client lifecycle, and seeding (>89% coverage).

